* Allergy to local anesthetics, tizanidine, or opioids;
* Severe cardiac, pulmonary, hepatic, or renal dysfunction;
* History of chronic pain or long-term use of opioid analgesics prior to surgery;
* Pregnant or breastfeeding women;
* Mental illness or cognitive impairment that prevents the participant from cooperating with pain scoring and other assessments;
* Other circumstances deemed by the investigator to make the participant unsuitable for participation in this study;

