Inclusion Criteria:

1. The participant agrees to enter this clinical trial and consents to long-term follow-up;
2. 35 ≤ age \ 1.0 cm², and mean aortic valve pressure gradient \< 40 mmHg) non-rheumatic aortic valve stenosis;
