5. Anti-Neutrophil Cytoplasmic Antibody-Associated Vasculitis (ANCA-AAV), including granulomatous polyangiitis (GPA), or microscopic vasculitis (MPA), or eosinophilic granulomatous polyangiitis (EGPA),2022 ACR/EULAR criteria, and ANCA antibody-positive, including c-ANCA/p-ANCA/anti Proteinase 3(PR3)/anti-Myeloperoxidase(MPO) positive.
